{
  "title": "THA Sciatic Nerve Palsy",
  "url": "https://www.orthobullets.com/recon/3105/tha-sciatic-nerve-palsy",
  "subtitle": "Updated: Sep 2 2024",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "summary",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "THA Sciatic Nerve Palsy is an uncommon, but potentially devastating complication following THA that may lead to persistent foot drop.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "3",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Diagnosis can be made clinically with post-operative complaints of numbness and paresthesias along the sciatic nerve distribution and weakness of the dorsiflexors of the foot.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        },
        {
          "text": "Treatment is placing the hip in extension and knee in flexion immediately post-operatively. Observation and AFO in the presence of foot drop are recommended to monitor for recovery of the nerve.",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "epidemiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Incidence",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**uncommon (0-3%)**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "most common cause for medical malpractice litigation following THA",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anatomic location",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "-1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**peroneal division of sciatic nerve most commonly affected (80%)**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "**sciatic nerve travels closest to acetabulum at level of ischium**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [
                    {
                      "src": "https://upload.orthobullets.com/topic/3105/images/a07cfcd3-94fa-4263-9fab-456f8d2d8248_sciatic_nerve..jpg",
                      "caption": "Sciatic nerve"
                    }
                  ],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**exercise care with posterior acetabular retraction when hip in flexed position**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "less commonly affected nerves include",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "femoral",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "obturator",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "superior gluteal",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "4",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Etiology",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "-1",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Causes",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "direct trauma",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "stretch",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "**compression due to** hematoma",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "heat from polymethylmethacralate polymerization",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "unrecognized lumbar lateral recess stenosis",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "4",
              "children": []
            },
            {
              "text": "unknown (40%)",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "**Risk factors**",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "**for motor nerve palsies include**",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "5",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "developmental dysplasia of the hip",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "revision surgery",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "female gender",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "limb lengthening",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "posttraumatic arthritis",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "**surgeon self-rated procedure as difficult**",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "5",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "pre-existing lumbar stenosis",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                },
                {
                  "text": "operative time",
                  "table": null,
                  "images": [],
                  "importance": "-1",
                  "children": []
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Presentation",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Post-operative complaints of numbness, paresthesias, or weakness",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "1",
          "children": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Imaging",
      "table": null,
      "images": [],
      "importance": "3",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Post-operative CT",
          "table": null,
          "images": [],
          "importance": "1",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "may be helpful if hematoma suspected",
              "table": null,
              "images": [],
              "importance": "1",
              "children": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
